{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2021-10-18 08:35:00', 'title': 'GOLDMAN SACHS NAMES YOSSI LEVI TO ITS 100 MOST INTRIGUING ENTREPRENEURS', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #GSINNOVATORS--GETTACAR CEO YOSSI LEVI RECOGNIZED BY GOLDMAN SACHS AS ONE OF THE TOP 100 INTRIGUING ENTREPRENEURS AND INNOVATORS OF 2021'}{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2021-10-18 08:34:00', 'title': 'DISCGENICS HONORED BY GOLDMAN SACHS FOR ENTREPRENEURSHIP', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY, OCT. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 DISCGENICS, INC., A CLINICAL STAGE BIOPHARMACEUTICAL COMPANY FOCUSED ON DEVELOPING REGENERATIVE CELL-BASED THERAPIES THAT ALLEVIATE PAIN AND RESTORE FUNCTION IN PATIENTS WITH DEGENERATIVE DISEASES OF THE SPINE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GOLDMAN SACHS (NYSE:GS) RECOGNIZED DISCGENICS CHAIRMAN AND CEO FLAGG FLANAGAN AS ONE OF THE 100 MOST INTRIGUING ENTREPRENEURS OF 2021 AT ITS BUILDERS + INNOVATORS SUMMIT IN HEALDSBURG, CALIFORNIA. GOLDMAN SACHS SELECTED MR.'}